{%- comment -%}
  The plain theme's whole style layer.

  Horizon's `base.css` stays, because the header, the footer, the cart and the
  search page are still Horizon's own sections and they are unreadable without
  it. Everything after it is gone: no Rubik, no Assistant, no `pluma.css`, no
  `pl-story.css`, no `pdp.css`, no `pluma.js`. `bs.css` is loaded last and is
  the only thing deciding how this store looks.

  Three requests instead of seven, and the two font requests that used to sit
  on the critical path are two fewer round trips before first paint.
{%- endcomment -%}

